25
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:15.042
Straight, Straight! Turn, Turn! Next to, Next to!

26
00:01:15.342 --> 00:01:18.134
Corner, Corner! Nearby, Nearby!

27
00:01:18.434 --> 00:01:21.051
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

28
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:23.945
